<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <%- include('common/head.ejs', { pageTitle: 'Privacy Policy' }) %>
  <body>
    <%- include('common/header.ejs') %>
    <main class="main">
      <div class="main-item vflex align-items-stretch">
        <div class="py-4">
          <h2 class="heading-noline display-6">Overview</h2>
          <hr class="divider my-2" />
          <p>
            Cedar Groves Executive Par 3 &amp; Driving Range ("Cedar Groves",
            "we", "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains how we
            collect, use, and protect personal information when you visit
            cedargrovesgolf.ca or contact us through it. We handle personal
            information in accordance with Canada's Personal Information
            Protection and Electronic Documents Act (PIPEDA).
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="py-4">
          <h2 class="heading-noline display-6">Information we collect</h2>
          <hr class="divider my-2" />
          <p>
            <strong>Information you provide.</strong> When you contact us, we
            collect the information you choose to give us, such as your name,
            email address, and message.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> When you visit
            the website, standard technical information such as your IP address,
            browser type, device information, and the pages you view may be
            collected for security and to keep the website running.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="py-4">
          <h2 class="heading-noline display-6">How we use your information</h2>
          <hr class="divider my-2" />
          <ul>
            <li>To respond to your questions and requests.</li>
            <li>To protect the website from spam, fraud, and abuse.</li>
            <li>To operate, maintain, and improve the website.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information, and we use
            it only for the purposes described in this policy or as required by
            law.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="py-4">
          <h2 class="heading-noline display-6">Service providers</h2>
          <hr class="divider my-2" />
          <p>
            We use trusted third-party providers for website hosting, email, and
            spam protection. They process information on our behalf and only as
            needed to provide their services. Some providers may store or
            process information outside Canada, including in the United States,
            where it may be subject to the laws of that country.
          </p>
          <p>
            This website uses Google reCAPTCHA to protect against spam. Its use
            is subject to Google's
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="color-gold hover transition">Privacy Policy</a>
            and
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="color-gold hover transition">Terms of Service</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="py-4">
          <h2 class="heading-noline display-6">Cookies</h2>
          <hr class="divider my-2" />
          <p>
            We use cookies only where they are necessary for the website to work
            and to keep it secure. We do not use cookies for advertising or
            analytics. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings,
            though some features may not work as a result.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="py-4">
          <h2 class="heading-noline display-6">Retention</h2>
          <hr class="divider my-2" />
          <p>
            We keep personal information only as long as it is needed for the
            purposes described in this policy or as required by law, and then
            delete it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="py-4">
          <h2 class="heading-noline display-6">Security</h2>
          <hr class="divider my-2" />
          <p>
            We take reasonable measures to protect personal information from
            loss, misuse, and unauthorized access. No method of transmission or
            storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute
            security.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="py-4">
          <h2 class="heading-noline display-6">Your rights</h2>
          <hr class="divider my-2" />
          <p>
            You may ask to access the personal information we hold about you,
            ask us to correct it, or withdraw your consent and ask us to delete
            it, subject to legal requirements. To make a request, contact us
            using the details below. If you are not satisfied with our response,
            you may contact the
            <a href="https://www.priv.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="color-gold hover transition">Office of the Privacy Commissioner of Canada</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="py-4">
          <h2 class="heading-noline display-6">Changes to this policy</h2>
          <hr class="divider my-2" />
          <p>
            We may update this policy from time to time. Changes take effect
            when they are posted on this page.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="py-4">
          <h2 class="heading-noline display-6">Contact us</h2>
          <hr class="divider my-2" />
          <p>
            Cedar Groves Executive Par 3 &amp; Driving Range
            <br />
            2000 Golden Grove Road, Saint John, NB, E2N 2A1
            <br />
            <a href="mailto:contact@cedargrovesgolf.ca" class="color-gold hover transition">contact@cedargrovesgolf.ca</a>
            <br />
            <a href="tel:5068477273" class="color-gold hover transition">(506) 847-7273</a>
          </p>
          <p class="mb-0"><em>Last updated: November 2026</em></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <%- include('common/footer.html') %>
  </body>
</html>
